<title>BRAZIL: Usiminas 9 month net 192.1 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Usiminas 9 month net 192.1 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian steel company Usiminas reported the following nine-month results in a statement sent to Brazilian stock exchanges.</p>
<p>			 Nine month 1996	     Nine months 1995</p>
<p>    Net income	     192.1 million		N/A</p>
<p>    Gross revenues	 1.499 bln		N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
